{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF4", "text": "Good morning, Major. The calibration desk confirmed that the ten electronic test cables failed their scheduled calibration check but remain suitable for controlled calibration return. They must be sent to the calibration desk with a calibration request dated Tuesday. I should note that the signed calibration worksheet is complete and is awaiting property-section filing."}
